// UsdGeomModelAPI — model draw modes (the USD-native LOD / billboard-card
// mechanism). Reference: pxr/usd/usdGeom/modelAPI.h.
//
// A model can declare a `model:drawMode` (default | origin | bounds | cards |
// inherited). When applied, a renderer draws that proxy representation instead
// of the model's full geometry. `cards` draws textured billboards (the six
// `model:cardTexture{X,Y,Z}{Pos,Neg}` faces) sized to the model's bounds
// (`extentsHint`), in the `model:cardGeometry` layout (cross | box).


